  "_comment": "FelixGenome genome-wide, LIMITED covariates, rooted on the flare_lai_prod_set entity 'aou_lr_phase2_v1.autosomes' so every per-chromosome array is read from the 22 member rows in membership order (chr1..chr22, set by flare/configs/lai_prod_set.membership.tsv). chroms, phase_vcfs, flare_vcfs and joint_vcfs all come from the same member list, so index i is the same chromosome in each. phase_vcfs/flare_vcfs feed felixla Pack; joint_vcfs (the PropagateFlareAncestry annotated VCFs) is read only by the repeat branch. Same cohort, GRM VCFs, kinship and MAC as the chr22 pilot, so MakeGRM and the null fits call-cache. Outputs are written back onto the set row.",
